    "excerpt": "p. The east pontoon is closed for painting from 10 November. Visitors moor on the _west_ pontoon. Fuel is available as usual. bq. Please keep to 3 knots inside the harbour. bc. VHF channel 12 _. Pontoon _. Status East closed West open See and !images/pontoon.png!. fn1. Issued by the harbour master.",
